WEBVTT

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.819
the reason anyone
is interested in your land,

00:04:30.843 --> 00:04:32.987
and particularly
the United States, is oil.

00:04:33.011 --> 00:04:36.120
It's all about oil; you know that,
everybody knows that.

00:04:36.144 --> 00:04:39.244
People back in the United States
know it's about oil.

00:04:39.459 --> 00:04:44.557
It's because somebody else
has a design for your resource.

00:04:44.581 --> 00:04:47.134
It's your resource --
it's not somebody else's.

00:04:47.158 --> 00:04:50.136
It's your land; it's your resource.

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:51.833
Somebody else has a design for it.

00:04:52.778 --> 00:04:54.631
And you know why they have a design?

00:04:54.655 --> 00:04:56.752
You know why they have
their eyes set on it?

00:04:56.776 --> 00:04:58.850
Because they have
an entire economic system

00:04:58.874 --> 00:05:02.083
that's dependent
on that oil -- foreign oil,